    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i feel like i'm just a repeat of everything that went wrong before me... my dad, his dad, even his dad. the same mistakes, the same emptiness. it's like it's written in my DNA or something. i'm just waiting for the next disaster to hit so i can prove i'm no different.",
